	(text "If I want to utilize the full output range of the INA [V_Ref, 3.3VA], \nmy minimum expected gain would be on the order of 1.65V/6.66mV = 247. That seems excessive somehow."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 153.67 0)
		(effects
